  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: ShelfKeyPermission is replaced by ShelfPermission, with the same members; JSON names are unchanged. ShelfInfo gains Permission and OnReplica, which a server 3.0.0 or later sends. New: the types of plugins' documents and fields (PluginFileDetails, PluginFieldValue, SetPluginMetadataRequest, FileCriteria.PluginFields), derived files (DerivedKind, ShelfFile.Derived) and ErrorCodes.NotReady. Its assembly version leaves out the patch number. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/byte-shelf/blob/client-v4.0.0/ByteShelfCommon/README.md",
